It is better to use coef(lm.out)

> don't see the corresponding object available for the std. errors -- or
> better yet, the variance-covariance matrix.

library(MASS)
vcov(lm.out)

or do it by hand by

lm.sum <- summary(lm.out)
and look at the object after reading ?summary.lm

